                <mxCell id="uDNiRq8X2C779li-94Vc-0" value="There should be subscriber adapters with different Event type system. Also they can has own state if it has meaning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The implementation of Subscriber has close connection to Diffable Snapshot type.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=left;strokeColor=default;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=default;" parent="WVDOhqYdJEKCZgCYfekx-1" vertex="1">
